# MASTER PROMPT: RESOURCELOOP

## AI-Powered Resource Sharing, Equipment Rental and Institutional Resource Network

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect, AI engineer, security engineer and hackathon product developer.

Build a complete, professional, responsive, fully functional, full-stack web application named **ResourceLoop**.

Do not create only a landing page, static UI, frontend mockup or collection of disconnected screens. Build a working application with a real backend, persistent database, authentication, role-based permissions, API integration, booking management, equipment-request workflows and operational dashboards.

The application must be suitable for a 48-hour hackathon and demonstrate the complete resource-sharing lifecycle.

Generate the project files in the implementation order specified in this prompt. Create and connect the files, install the required dependencies, run the application, test the workflows and fix build errors.

Do not stop after generating the frontend.

