## Design direction

Use a modern, minimal visual system:

* Deep navy or charcoal text.
* Light neutral backgrounds.
* White cards.
* A restrained teal or emerald accent.
* Clear typography.
* Generous spacing.
* Subtle shadows.
* Consistent corner radii.
* Clear visual hierarchy.
* High-quality equipment imagery.
* Accessible colour contrast.

Avoid:

* Excessive gradients.
* Unnecessary glassmorphism.
* Random emoji icons.
* Oversized empty hero sections.
* Too many animations.
* Dense, cluttered dashboards.
* Generic AI-generated filler text.
* Fake statistics presented as real data.

Use Lucide icons consistently.

Use Framer Motion only for purposeful transitions and subtle interaction feedback.

